## Worksheet

**F1 – Core loop**: Single `GameState` instance `game`; `SeededRandom` (mulberry32) used for map, colonists, events, storms; `endTurn()` calls production→needs→morale→storm→repairs→caravan→events in fixed order. Score 2.

**F2 – Map**: 8x8 loop in `generateMap()`, terrain from `this.rng.next()`; `canBuild()` checks `terrain === required`; no adjacency bonus code found anywhere. Score 1.

**F3 – Economy**: `mine`(ore)→`smelter`(ore+power→metal) chain; `storageMax` caps enforced and overflow logged/capped in `processProduction`/`buyGood`. Score 2.

**F4 – Population**: colonists have skill/fatigue/morale/assigned; production formula in `processProduction` reads `col.level` only, never `col.skill` or `col.fatigue` (fatigue rises but never gates output). Score 1.

**F5 – Needs**: `processNeeds` consumes food/water and lowers morale on shortage; `processMorale` recovers morale (+10/turn); but morale is never read in `processProduction`'s output formula. Score 1.

**F6 – Research**: 8 nodes in `initResearch`; `canResearch`/`doResearch` enforce prereq+cost; `node.effects` object defined but never read anywhere else in the file. Score 1.

**F7 – Events**: 10 events in `processEvents`; selection is uniform `rng.range`, not weighted; every event has exactly one "OK" button/outcome, no branching choices; `eventCooldown` implemented. Score 1.

**F8 – Trade**: `goods` array has fixed hardcoded buy/sell prices, not derived from `game.resources` or a drifting variable; `buyGood`/`sellGood` both function; caravan `stock` limits buy. Score 1.

**F9 – Hazard**: `processStorm` fires on `turn%12===0`, severity grows with `turn`, damages buildings, `healthMul` reduces output, `processRepairs` spends `parts`; `stormMitigation`/`shield.mitigation` fields defined but never read in `processStorm`. Score 1.

**F10 – Save/load**: `save()` serializes full state to JSON string, copied via clipboard/prompt; `GameState.load()` wraps `JSON.parse` in try/catch, shows `e.message` on failure. Score 2.

**F11 – End conditions**: `checkWin`/`checkLose` both called in `handleEndTurn`; `getScore()` combines population/research/resources/turns; `showEndScreen` renders summary. Score 2.

**F12 – UI**: tab-btn click handlers switch `.active`; log entries show `[Turn ${entry.turn}]`; tile/tree-node tooltips show produce/consume/cost; keydown handler for 1-6/space; `@media (max-width:600px)` rules present. Score 2.

**F13 – Dev panel**: `runTests` asserts real invariants (storage caps, research prereqs, save/load round-trip, damage bounds); `runBenchmark` runs 200 headless `endTurn()` calls and prints `stateHash()`. Score 2.

**G1**: `research[key].effects` set in `initResearch` but no other code reads `.effects` — chain never continues into production formula. Score 0.

**G2**: shortage writes `col.morale -= 20` in `processNeeds` (real state change), but morale never appears in `processProduction`'s output math — final link missing. Score 1.

**G3**: `processStorm` sets `building.damage`; `healthMul = 1-damage*0.3` reduces output in `processProduction`; `processRepairs` spends `parts` and lowers `damage`, restoring `healthMul`. Full loop each relevant turn. Score 4.

**G4**: `goods` array in `renderTrade` uses static numeric `buy`/`sell` fields, never reads `game.resources` or any supply variable. Score 0.

**G5**: `showEventModal` always builds a single "OK" button calling `event.outcome()` — no event offers multiple choice branches. Score 0.

